1
00:00:00,736 --> 00:00:02,696
(Leonard:)Oh, good.
Do you have any fabric softener?

2
00:00:02,863 --> 00:00:04,573
(Penny:)Yeah, sure.

3
00:00:13,415 --> 00:00:16,455
What, are you washing a crocodile?

4
00:00:17,336 --> 00:00:19,466
(Leonard:)No. The pants that Stephanie got me.

5
00:00:19,630 --> 00:00:23,130
(Penny:)Oh, sweetie, you can't machine wash these.
They'll be ruined.

6
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:24,970
(Penny:)- You sure?
- Absolutely.

7
00:00:28,681 --> 00:00:31,601
(Leonard:)Oh, no. I wish you'd told me that sooner.

8
00:00:34,228 --> 00:00:36,978
- Are you guys having problems?
- No. Everything's fine.

9
00:00:37,439 --> 00:00:40,229
(Leonard:)- Really?
- Yeah, it's wonderful.

10
00:00:41,819 --> 00:00:45,489
(Leonard:)Okay, maybe this whole
living together happened...

11
00:00:45,656 --> 00:00:47,786
(Leonard:)...kind of suddenly,
but it's fine, it's great.

12
00:00:47,950 --> 00:00:51,240
Okay, Leonard, if you're uncomfortable
with the way things are going...

13
00:00:51,412 --> 00:00:53,412
(Penny:)...you're allowed to say something.

14
00:00:53,580 --> 00:00:55,960
(Leonard:)Are you sure? That doesn't sound right.

15
00:00:56,375 --> 00:01:00,025
(Penny:)Believe me, your feelings
are just as important as hers.

